WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:18,220
Just like me so much

2
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:20,860
I'm out of patience

3
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:21,860
run again

4
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:22,860
Kill you

5
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:24,110
no one captain

6
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:28,060
I have a next time

7
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:29,060
Thousands of losses

8
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:30,420
Can't be beaten to death

9
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:31,420
The more you fight, the happier you are

10
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:33,450
The brain circuit of a madman

11
00:00:33,450 --> 00:00:34,450
No one can see through it

12
00:00:34,450 --> 00:00:37,540
I don't have time to beat around the bush with you

13
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:38,540
you are not a fool

14
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:40,540
Almost got it, do you understand?

15
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:44,010
I didn't follow you around in circles

16
00:00:44,010 --> 00:00:46,010
I've always been serious about you

17
00:00:46,010 --> 00:00:47,010
From the first time I saw you
